{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-retrieval","title":"分布式检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/systems/distributed-retrieval","wordCount":961,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式检索\">分布式检索</h1><p>当单节点无法承载数据规模或查询吞吐时，搜索系统需要水平扩展。Elasticsearch 的分布式架构基于<strong>分片（Shard）<strong>和</strong>副本（Replica）</strong>，通过 scatter-gather 模式协调多节点查询。理解分片路由、查询协调流程和常见的分布式陷阱，是设计和运维大规模搜索系统的必要知识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Node1[节点 1]&#10;        P0[Primary Shard 0]&#10;        R1[Replica Shard 1]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Node2[节点 2]&#10;        P1[Primary Shard 1]&#10;        R2[Replica Shard 2]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Node3[节点 3]&#10;        P2[Primary Shard 2]&#10;        R0[Replica Shard 0]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    Client --&gt; Coord[协调节点\\nCoordinating Node]&#10;    Coord --&gt; Node1&#10;    Coord --&gt; Node2&#10;    Coord --&gt; Node3\">graph TB\n    subgraph Node1[节点 1]\n        P0[Primary Shard 0]\n        R1[Replica Shard 1]\n    end\n    subgraph Node2[节点 2]\n        P1[Primary Shard 1]\n        R2[Replica Shard 2]\n    end\n    subgraph Node3[节点 3]\n        P2[Primary Shard 2]\n        R0[Replica Shard 0]\n    end\n\n    Client --&gt; Coord[协调节点\\nCoordinating Node]\n    Coord --&gt; Node1\n    Coord --&gt; Node2\n    Coord --&gt; Node3</pre><p><strong>分片（Primary Shard）</strong>：将索引水平切分的基本单位，每个分片是一个独立的 Lucene 索引。</p>\n<p><strong>副本（Replica Shard）</strong>：主分片的只读副本，提供：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>高可用</strong>：主分片故障时，副本提升为主分片</li>\n<li><strong>读扩展</strong>：查询请求可以路由到主分片或任一副本</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分片数量在创建索引时确定，不可修改</td>\n<td>路由算法依赖分片总数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单个分片推荐大小 10-50GB</td>\n<td>过大影响 recovery 速度，过小增加 merge 开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副本不能与其主分片在同一节点</td>\n<td>避免单节点故障导致数据丢失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"文档路由机制\">文档路由机制</h2><p>写入文档时，ES 通过以下公式决定路由到哪个主分片：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>shard_id</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>routing_key</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>number_of_primary_shards</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{shard\\_id} = \\text{hash}(\\text{routing\\_key}) \\bmod \\text{number\\_of\\_primary\\_shards}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shard_id</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">routing_key</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">number_of_primary_shards</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>默认 <code>routing_key = document._id</code>，也可以自定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// 写入时指定 routing&#10;PUT /my-index/_doc/doc123?routing=user_001&#10;{&#10;  &quot;user_id&quot;: &quot;user_001&quot;,&#10;  &quot;content&quot;: &quot;example document&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 查询时指定同一 routing（保证查同一分片，减少 scatter）&#10;GET /my-index/_search?routing=user_001&#10;{&#10;  &quot;query&quot;: {&quot;term&quot;: {&quot;user_id&quot;: &quot;user_001&quot;}}&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 写入时指定 routing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PUT /my-index/_doc/doc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">123</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">?routing=user_</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"example document\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 查询时指定同一 routing（保证查同一分片，减少 scatter）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">GET /my-index/_search?routing=user_</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"term\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>路由的工程价值</strong>：同一 <code>routing_key</code> 的所有文档都在同一分片，可以实现 <strong>shard-level collocation</strong>，避免跨分片 gather 开销，特别适合多租户（per-tenant shard）场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"scatter-gather-查询流程\">Scatter-Gather 查询流程</h2><p>ES 的分布式查询采用两阶段 scatter-gather 协议：</p>\n<p><strong>Phase 1 — Query Phase（散播）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1. 客户端请求到达协调节点（任意节点）&#10;2. 协调节点向所有相关分片（主分片或副本）广播查询&#10;3. 每个分片在本地执行查询，返回 Top-K doc_id + score（不返回 source）&#10;4. 协调节点收集所有分片的 Top-K 结果，全局排序，确定最终 Top-K 文档\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. 客户端请求到达协调节点（任意节点）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 协调节点向所有相关分片（主分片或副本）广播查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 每个分片在本地执行查询，返回 Top-K doc_id + score（不返回 source）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 协调节点收集所有分片的 Top-K 结果，全局排序，确定最终 Top-K 文档</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Phase 2 — Fetch Phase（聚合）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"5. 协调节点向包含这些文档的分片发送 Multi Get 请求&#10;6. 各分片返回完整文档内容（_source）&#10;7. 协调节点组装最终响应\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>5. 协调节点向包含这些文档的分片发送 Multi Get 请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>6. 各分片返回完整文档内容（_source）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>7. 协调节点组装最终响应</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"查询 Top-10，5个分片：&#10;  每个分片返回 Top-10 → 协调节点收到 50 个候选&#10;  全局排序 → 最终 Top-10&#10;  Fetch 这 10 个文档的完整内容\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>查询 Top-10，5个分片：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  每个分片返回 Top-10 → 协调节点收到 50 个候选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  全局排序 → 最终 Top-10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Fetch 这 10 个文档的完整内容</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>散播放大效应（Scatter Amplification）</strong>：查询 <code>from=9000, size=10</code> 时，每个分片需要返回 Top-9010 结果，协调节点处理 N×9010 个候选——深翻页在分布式场景下代价极高。推荐用 <code>search_after</code> 游标替代深翻页。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关性得分的分布式问题\">相关性得分的分布式问题</h2><p>BM25 的 IDF 计算依赖全局文档频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>df</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{df}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">df</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但在分布式环境下，每个分片只知道本地的文档频率，可能导致<strong>跨分片得分不可比</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"全局: df(&quot;python&quot;) = 1000, N = 10000&#10;      IDF = log(10000/1000) = 2.30&#10;&#10;分片A: df(&quot;python&quot;) = 200, N = 2000&#10;       IDF = log(2000/200) = 2.30  ✓（碰巧一致）&#10;&#10;分片B: df(&quot;python&quot;) = 100, N = 2000&#10;       IDF = log(2000/100) = 2.30 ≠ 真实 IDF  ✗\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>全局: df(\"python\") = 1000, N = 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      IDF = log(10000/1000) = 2.30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>分片A: df(\"python\") = 200, N = 2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       IDF = log(2000/200) = 2.30  ✓（碰巧一致）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>分片B: df(\"python\") = 100, N = 2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       IDF = log(2000/100) = 2.30 ≠ 真实 IDF  ✗</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>解决方案</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DFS（Distributed Frequency Statistics）</td>\n<td>查询前先收集全局 df 统计</td>\n<td>分片数据分布不均时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>search_type=dfs_query_then_fetch</code></td>\n<td>ES 的 DFS 模式</td>\n<td>小数据集精确得分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增加文档数量</td>\n<td>数据量大时分片统计趋近全局</td>\n<td>生产环境通常足够</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由保证均匀分布</td>\n<td>通过路由确保词项均匀分布在分片中</td>\n<td>可控场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"副本策略与读写一致性\">副本策略与读写一致性</h2><p><strong>写一致性（Write Consistency）</strong>：ES 默认 <code>wait_for_active_shards=1</code>，只要主分片确认即返回成功。设置 <code>wait_for_active_shards=all</code> 要求所有副本确认，但增加写入延迟。</p>\n<p><strong>读一致性（Read-Your-Writes）</strong>：写入后立即读取可能因 refresh 延迟（1s）读不到最新数据。解决方案：写入后指定 <code>?refresh=wait_for</code>（等待下次 refresh）或客户端延迟读取。</p>\n<p><strong>副本数量建议</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>副本数</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发/测试环境</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>节省资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产单数据中心</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>一份冗余够用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多数据中心 HA</td>\n<td>2+</td>\n<td>跨 AZ 副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读密集型</td>\n<td>2-3</td>\n<td>读请求均摊到更多副本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>分片</strong>是水平扩展的基本单位，分片数在建索引时确定，不可修改</li>\n<li><strong>文档路由</strong>：<code>hash(routing_key) mod num_shards</code>，自定义 routing 可实现 shard-level collocation</li>\n<li><strong>scatter-gather 两阶段</strong>：Query Phase 收集 Top-K ID + Score，Fetch Phase 获取文档内容</li>\n<li>深翻页（from + size）在分布式下有散播放大效应，推荐 <code>search_after</code> 游标</li>\n<li>分布式 IDF 不精确问题：数据量足够时影响可忽略；小数据集用 DFS 模式</li>\n<li>副本不仅提供高可用，还提升读吞吐；副本数根据读写比和 HA 需求设定</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>章内延伸</strong>：搜索引擎架构（本章第 1 篇）讲解单节点 segment 基础；查询处理（本章第 3 篇）在分片上执行具体查询逻辑。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式检索","id":"分布式检索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"文档路由机制","id":"文档路由机制"},{"level":2,"text":"Scatter-Gather 查询流程","id":"scatter-gather-查询流程"},{"level":2,"text":"相关性得分的分布式问题","id":"相关性得分的分布式问题"},{"level":2,"text":"副本策略与读写一致性","id":"副本策略与读写一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"搜索引擎核心架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/systems/search-engine-architecture"},"next":{"title":"查询处理与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/systems/query-processing"}}